## Test the link

Press Tab once on the page. The skip link should appear. Activate it, then press Tab again: focus should land on the first control in the main content. Repeat after a change of page, at 200% zoom, at 320 pixels wide, in light and dark modes, with two theme colours and with a screen reader. See [Test the interface](../accessibility/testing.html).
